    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1747043826\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1747043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1747043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1747043826\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/3a9d0ae9be0d2d8c467bb42545a393a1.avif?t=1747043826\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/f4f3c081fd7ac8f4181b9817d6cc6b00.poster.avif?t=1747043826\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/f4f3c081fd7ac8f4181b9817d6cc6b00.webp?t=1747043826\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=56 /></picture></span>&quot;After getting involved with those guys, I'm afraid I'll become less and less like myself.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist wakes up in an unknown world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a world ruled by succubi, a world excessively cruel to humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To return to their original world, they must defeat the succubus queen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he finally encounter the queen, things aren't as simple as he seem...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/9c19b6dc24fb8832c28162b0f4a5c304.poster.avif?t=1747043826\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/9c19b6dc24fb8832c28162b0f4a5c304.webp?t=1747043826\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An estimated 10-hour real-time combat RPG for the first playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse erotic scenes, rich story plot of more than 400,000 words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite pixel animations when coming into contact with enemy succubi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/1aa575f9e7fd1795555f44c12ad5a8c9.poster.avif?t=1747043826\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/1aa575f9e7fd1795555f44c12ad5a8c9.webm?t=1747043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/1aa575f9e7fd1795555f44c12ad5a8c9.mp4?t=1747043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuation of the gameplay system from the previous installment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More varied and challenging enemy designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, there are more hidden items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is filled with greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuing from the previous installment, there are victim's notes in this one too!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect these notes from the victims,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and gradually learn about the habits of the succubi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/c2e41d00288fdc492363bc23b977dd30.poster.avif?t=1747043826\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/c2e41d00288fdc492363bc23b977dd30.webp?t=1747043826\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape this world controlled by succubi, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must utilize all the resources you find,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >whether it's choosing to evade succubi or defeat them, do your best to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to upgrade weapons, daggers, guns, hand grenades... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >skillfully take down the succubi one by one from a distance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and finally confront the queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/36339ee2491f2036626b82c90c38e4fb.poster.avif?t=1747043826\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/36339ee2491f2036626b82c90c38e4fb.webm?t=1747043826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/36339ee2491f2036626b82c90c38e4fb.mp4?t=1747043826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you make it out alive, or become a roadside skeleton, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it's all up to your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614100/extras/a36fde9cfa253c9121128442e209f120.avif?t=1747043826\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
